    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="82e3090c-5dd2-5562-a1bd-973ae685c498" activityNameId="cf30ec25-c662-545b-9277-7529bf8e1e62" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Viscose fibres, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Viscose fibres, at plant
The multioutput-process "viscose fibres" delivers the co-products "viscose fibres, at plant", "sodium sulphate from viscose production, at plant" and "sulphuric acid from viscose production, at plant". The allocation is based on economic criteria and was applied except for the used sulphate pulp.;
UUID: cb128b98-9f59-3bba-a73d-dd28b73332ca
This data includes the transformation of sulphate pulp to spinnable viscose using CS2
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Transformation of sulfat pulp by CS2 to spinnable viscose
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: World production about 1.8 million tons
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other technologies.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cb128b98-9f59-3bba-a73d-dd28b73332ca.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
